WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
<i>Previously on Captain Tsubasa<i>.</i></i>

00:03.730 --> 00:06.980
<i>Tsubasa Ozora, a young boy who really loves football,</i>

00:06.980 --> 00:11.280
<i>is by a coincidence witness to a fight in his new town over a football field</i>

00:11.280 --> 00:14.700
<i>between Genzo Wakabayash and Ryo Ishizaki.</i>

00:14.700 --> 00:18.950
<i>Full of confidence that he won't let in any goals,</i>

00:18.950 --> 00:21.410
<i>Wakabayashi stops all attempts</i>

00:21.410 --> 00:23.370
<i>from the college students gathered by Ishizaki.</i>

00:24.330 --> 00:27.090
<i>His incredible performance</i>

00:27.090 --> 00:28.920
<i>catches Tsubasa's interest.</i>

00:28.920 --> 00:31.840
<i>And he throws him a challenge!</i>

00:31.840 --> 00:34.260
<i>Hey Wakabashi, listen close now!</i>

00:34.760 --> 00:37.930
<i>He's the one who challenged you!</i>

00:38.560 --> 00:39.760
<i>Nonsense!</i>

00:39.760 --> 00:43.270
<i>There's no way a squirt like that has a powerful enough kick!</i>

00:43.770 --> 00:47.610
<i>Let's find out if he really is the one!</i>

00:48.150 --> 00:49.900
<i>Take this!</i>

00:49.900 --> 00:52.110
<i>That's dangerous! Get away!</i>

00:58.580 --> 01:01.450
<i>Is this a coincidence or destiny?</i>

01:01.450 --> 01:07.460
<i>Either way, it is like this that Tsubasa Ozora and Genzo Wakabayashi meet.</i>

01:14.340 --> 01:16.260
How's that, Wakabayashi?

01:16.260 --> 01:18.760
You've seen what he's capable of!

01:20.850 --> 01:23.350
<i>Sign: Challenge from Tsubasa Ozora</i>

01:25.850 --> 01:28.560
You'll take on my challenge, right?

01:29.520 --> 01:32.070
Why did you throw me it?

01:32.070 --> 01:37.320
He witnessed your saves from the rugby and the baseball player attempts the other day.

01:38.280 --> 01:40.490
So that's why.

01:40.490 --> 01:42.040
Captain!

01:42.450 --> 01:43.580
It's you guys.

01:43.580 --> 01:44.950
What's up?

01:44.950 --> 01:47.370
Weren't you going home?

01:47.370 --> 01:49.130
Perfect timing.

01:50.710 --> 01:53.090
I admit he's got a very powerful shot.

01:53.500 --> 01:57.090
But it'd be a big error to assume he plays football just going by that!

01:57.090 --> 01:58.340
What?!

01:58.340 --> 02:00.800
If you want to challenge me...

02:01.760 --> 02:04.180
...he's got to dribble all of them!

02:04.180 --> 02:05.100
What?

02:05.100 --> 02:08.350
Only after that I'll let him challenge me!

02:26.080 --> 02:31.670
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

02:26.080 --> 02:31.670
<i>koronde toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

02:31.670 --> 02:36.340
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

02:31.670 --> 02:36.340
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

02:37.590 --> 02:42.260
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

02:37.590 --> 02:42.260
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

02:43.140 --> 02:50.850
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

02:43.140 --> 02:50.850
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:50.850 --> 02:56.610
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:50.850 --> 02:56.610
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

02:56.610 --> 03:05.370
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:56.610 --> 03:05.370
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

03:05.370 --> 03:10.920
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

03:05.370 --> 03:10.920
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

03:10.920 --> 03:16.840
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

03:10.920 --> 03:16.840
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

03:16.840 --> 03:18.510
<i>Run & Run!</i>

03:18.510 --> 03:25.720
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

03:18.510 --> 03:25.720
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

03:25.720 --> 03:28.730
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Go, our kicks!</i>

03:25.720 --> 03:28.730
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kick o</i>

03:28.730 --> 03:33.150
<i>Leap out into a huge TV</i>

03:28.730 --> 03:33.150
<i>tobidasô dodekai TV</i>

03:45.370 --> 03:47.950
<b>Episode 2:
He's flying!</b>

03:45.370 --> 03:47.950
What do you mean, captain?

03:47.950 --> 03:49.700
Precisely what I said.

03:49.700 --> 03:51.870
Follow me orders.

03:51.870 --> 03:53.920
That's okay, but...

03:53.920 --> 03:56.040
...who's that squirt?

03:57.340 --> 04:04.430
<i>Sign: Challenge from Tsubasa Ozora</i>

03:57.710 --> 03:59.420
What's that?

03:59.420 --> 04:04.430
He sent this ball to my house by shooting from unbelievably far.

04:10.480 --> 04:13.850
So that means you'll take on the challenge?

04:13.850 --> 04:16.230
Yes, that's what it means.

04:16.650 --> 04:18.070
Hey, Wakabayashi!

04:18.070 --> 04:21.240
It's <i>you</i> Tsubasa wants to challenge!

04:21.240 --> 04:24.200
It's pretty sick he's got to challenge the entire B-team!

04:24.200 --> 04:27.120
If he doesn't want to, he'll have to leave.

04:27.120 --> 04:29.490
That's dirty, Wakabayashi!

04:29.490 --> 04:31.040
I'll do it!

04:31.040 --> 04:34.210
What? You'll do it? Are you serious?

04:34.210 --> 04:36.580
But he's about to accept my challenge.

04:36.580 --> 04:40.000
Hold on! You're alone against all of them!

04:41.340 --> 04:45.180
I don't really get what's going on, but it seems like fun.

04:45.180 --> 04:47.470
He's got the balls to challenge the captain.

04:47.470 --> 04:50.270
He's already lost!

04:51.560 --> 04:53.690
Don't worry. Just count on me.

04:53.690 --> 04:54.560
Uh?

04:55.020 --> 04:57.480
You're a really weird guy.

05:09.780 --> 05:11.160
Hey, Tsubasa!

05:12.120 --> 05:14.040
I just noticed but,

05:14.040 --> 05:16.750
will you be okay playing with those shoes?

05:19.630 --> 05:22.670
Yeah! They're all I have right now.

05:22.670 --> 05:25.130
What?! It'll be impossible!

05:26.970 --> 05:30.600
They might be the B-team, they're still pretty good!

05:30.600 --> 05:34.310
In addition, you're alone. That's a double handicap!

05:34.310 --> 05:37.150
You just like a bird with broken wings!

05:37.150 --> 05:38.560
But...

05:38.560 --> 05:42.190
Someone's got an extra pair of cleats? Borrow them to him.

05:42.190 --> 05:43.570
Uh, okay!

05:43.570 --> 05:45.490
Thank you, Wakabayashi!

05:45.490 --> 05:47.110
I don't need to be thanked.

05:47.110 --> 05:50.990
I just didn't want you to have an excuse when you lost because you didn't have cleats.

05:56.460 --> 05:58.580
All right, let's challenge 'em!

06:05.420 --> 06:08.930
<i>I'm sure I've seen that man somewhere before...</i>

06:09.590 --> 06:11.220
I wonder if he'll be okay.

06:15.850 --> 06:17.440
You can see him, right?

06:18.020 --> 06:20.900
He's the one who brought you back!

06:21.360 --> 06:23.900
His name is Wakabayashi.

06:23.900 --> 06:26.650
There he goes talking to the ball again...

06:26.650 --> 06:31.030
He won last year's national championship without letting in any goals.

06:31.030 --> 06:33.700
He's an extraordinary goalkeeper!

06:34.540 --> 06:37.250
But I have to dribble all those players first,

06:37.250 --> 06:40.170
before I can challenge that keeper.

06:40.170 --> 06:42.420
What's he babbling?

06:42.420 --> 06:44.340
He's talking to the ball!

06:44.340 --> 06:46.710
He's got to have some screws loose!

06:47.380 --> 06:51.840
You saved my life when I was really young.

06:51.840 --> 06:53.970
I'll need you again!

06:57.730 --> 07:01.480
I want to challenge him at all costs!

07:03.480 --> 07:05.280
Stop daydreaming!

07:05.280 --> 07:07.240
Hurry up and take the ball from him!

07:07.240 --> 07:08.780
Y-Yes!

07:08.780 --> 07:09.950
All right, let's do it!

07:09.950 --> 07:10.740
Yeah!

07:12.450 --> 07:13.870
Ready?

07:13.870 --> 07:14.780
Let's do this!

07:14.780 --> 07:15.700
Go!

07:23.460 --> 07:24.340
What?

07:27.010 --> 07:29.050
He got rid of three in one instant!

07:47.780 --> 07:49.570
<i>I can't believe this!</i>

07:49.570 --> 07:52.280
<i>His shot under the driving bus...</i>

07:52.280 --> 07:54.490
<i>These dribbles...</i>

07:54.490 --> 07:57.370
<i>Despite his young age, </i>

07:57.370 --> 07:59.500
<i>he's already friend with the ball!</i>

08:00.290 --> 08:01.710
<i>There's no doubt.</i>

08:01.710 --> 08:03.670
<i>This boy...</i>

08:03.670 --> 08:05.340
<i>It's this boy!</i>

08:05.340 --> 08:07.590
Go, Tsubasa!

08:10.470 --> 08:12.220
That squirt!

08:12.220 --> 08:15.220
Don't let him shoot! Use block defense!

08:21.940 --> 08:23.600
He's flying!

08:24.350 --> 08:25.360
What?!

08:34.990 --> 08:36.240
Go in!

08:40.750 --> 08:42.620
The ball's still in play!

08:45.250 --> 08:47.540
It's a bit of a waste,

08:47.540 --> 08:50.260
but this challenge's worth a bit of whisky!

08:55.260 --> 08:57.640
I know now, he's...

08:57.640 --> 09:00.390
...he's the forward of the Brazilian national team,

09:00.390 --> 09:02.060
Roberto Hongo!

09:02.060 --> 09:04.600
Finish it with this cross!

09:14.570 --> 09:17.820
<i>This was how the first challenge between</i>

09:17.820 --> 09:22.370
<i>the two football prodigies Tsubasa Ozora and Genzo Wakabayashi found place.</i>

09:22.370 --> 09:24.660
<i>Nobody could imagine that later, </i>

09:24.660 --> 09:30.960
<i>Japanese football would get tremendously better with their impulse.</i>

09:45.690 --> 09:47.730
Yes! He's scored!

10:04.370 --> 10:05.040
Genzo!

10:05.040 --> 10:06.790
Captain!

10:06.790 --> 10:07.540
Are you okay?

10:07.540 --> 10:09.130
Hold out!

10:11.840 --> 10:12.630
You okay?

10:12.630 --> 10:13.130
Don't touch me!

10:13.840 --> 10:15.590
What's wrong with your head, Wakabayashi?

10:15.590 --> 10:17.300
Shut up!

10:26.430 --> 10:27.940
Hey, you're bleeding!

10:29.190 --> 10:31.190
Captain!

10:31.190 --> 10:32.690
Genzo!

10:34.150 --> 10:36.110
<i>I lost!</i>

10:36.110 --> 10:39.160
<i>I lose to that squirt!</i>

10:41.370 --> 10:43.870
Tsubasa Ozora, was it?

10:43.870 --> 10:44.620
Yeah.

10:45.330 --> 10:46.500
A match.

10:46.500 --> 10:47.540
What?

10:47.540 --> 10:50.290
We'll play a match!

10:51.250 --> 10:55.300
This duel can't be determined by this challenge!

10:55.300 --> 10:57.420
Only a match can!

10:57.420 --> 11:00.640
I'll take your challenge during the inter-school tournament!

11:00.640 --> 11:01.970
The inter-school tournament?

11:02.930 --> 11:04.390
Stop, Wakabayashi!

11:06.810 --> 11:07.890
Listen!

11:07.890 --> 11:10.900
If you can get even one goal there,

11:10.900 --> 11:13.650
I will admit my defeat.

11:14.900 --> 11:16.480
All right, it's on!

11:16.480 --> 11:19.280
It doesn't matter who wins the match!

11:19.280 --> 11:22.910
It's only to see if you can score a goal at me!

11:40.550 --> 11:42.010
Ishizaki.

11:42.010 --> 11:45.050
You are allowed to use the pitch
until the inter-school tournament.

11:46.100 --> 11:47.930
Train a bit

11:47.930 --> 11:50.560
so you won't drag him down.

11:51.810 --> 11:52.940
Let's go!

11:52.940 --> 11:54.060
Y-Yes!

11:54.940 --> 11:56.440
Hey, wait!

11:57.570 --> 11:59.570
The cleats, the cleats!

11:59.570 --> 12:01.110
O-Oh yeah...

12:01.110 --> 12:01.910
I don't want them!

12:06.240 --> 12:07.870
Thank you!

12:07.870 --> 12:10.120
Uh-Uh, you're welcome.

12:10.120 --> 12:12.920
Let's meet at the inter-school tournament!

12:21.170 --> 12:25.050
Wakabayashi was raging like a mad.

12:25.050 --> 12:28.310
I thought he was going to hit you!

12:28.310 --> 12:31.980
But, it's really cool you scored a goal at him!

12:31.980 --> 12:32.940
Thanks.

12:33.770 --> 12:35.360
You made your way in.

12:38.070 --> 12:39.480
Ishizaki!

12:39.480 --> 12:39.900
Here!

12:42.070 --> 12:43.450
Sorry!

12:44.700 --> 12:48.580
It may not look like it,
but I'm the captain of Nankatsu!

12:49.370 --> 12:50.830
Pass me the ball!

12:52.830 --> 12:53.960
Sure!

12:55.080 --> 12:57.920
I'll introduce you to our team!

12:57.920 --> 13:00.170
Yeah! Thank you!

13:00.170 --> 13:03.380
What's this inter-school tournament he was talking about?

13:03.840 --> 13:06.180
Well, about that...

13:06.180 --> 13:11.020
First, know that Nankatsu and Shutetsu are rivals in this city!

13:11.020 --> 13:11.890
Rivals?

13:11.890 --> 13:14.520
Yes! Damn Shutetsu!

13:15.770 --> 13:19.650
Their football team is really famous.

13:19.650 --> 13:22.240
They've gotten all the best players,

13:22.240 --> 13:24.280
so we get all the worst ones!

13:27.660 --> 13:32.410
There's nothing but conflicts between Nankatsu and Shutetsu!

13:33.080 --> 13:35.670
Today's fight over the football field,

13:35.670 --> 13:38.250
is just one between many.

13:38.250 --> 13:41.670
You said we should share the field,

13:41.670 --> 13:43.670
but that's not the real issue!

13:45.840 --> 13:47.760
Sure sounds like it.

13:47.760 --> 13:51.010
So, about the inter-school tournament,

13:51.510 --> 13:54.270
it's an annual competition between

13:54.270 --> 13:57.850
Nankatsu and Shutetsu's sports clubs.

13:57.850 --> 14:00.360
It's like a festival.

14:00.360 --> 14:04.440
Here, that popular happening surpasses the sports festival itself!

14:04.780 --> 14:06.650
Wow, that's impressive!

14:06.650 --> 14:10.620
All of our clubs are as good as Shutetsu's

14:10.620 --> 14:12.950
except football.

14:13.790 --> 14:19.500
So we're a burden to the other clubs all the time.

14:20.500 --> 14:26.880
But with you on the team I'm sure we can put up a good show!

14:26.880 --> 14:28.050
Yeah!

14:32.970 --> 14:33.680
Here I go!

14:34.390 --> 14:35.930
Darn, I missed!

14:41.020 --> 14:43.270
Thanks for that!

14:43.270 --> 14:46.190
Nah, don't mention it!

14:46.650 --> 14:49.360
You offered me a beautiful present,

14:50.910 --> 14:52.780
Tsubasa Ozora.

14:54.080 --> 14:56.290
My name is Roberto Hongo.

14:56.290 --> 14:57.370
nice to meet you.

15:00.380 --> 15:04.090
I know you well!
I've watched many of your matches!

15:05.210 --> 15:06.590
Thank you!

15:06.590 --> 15:08.970
I'm too am glad to meet you.

15:08.970 --> 15:11.720
He stinks alcohol!
He's just a drunkard!

15:11.720 --> 15:14.310
Hello!
Are you a friend of Tsubasa?

15:14.310 --> 15:15.060
Yes.

15:15.060 --> 15:17.810
I'm Roberto Hongo!
Nice to meet you!

15:17.810 --> 15:18.980
Nice to meet you...

15:18.980 --> 15:21.650
Do you like football, too?

15:21.650 --> 15:23.440
Yeah, I do, but...

15:23.440 --> 15:24.730
Really?

15:26.190 --> 15:28.110
I'm crazy in love about it!

15:28.860 --> 15:31.240
He sure is enthusiastic...

15:32.160 --> 15:37.250
How about I coach you until the inter-school tournament?

15:38.200 --> 15:41.500
Our team? Coached by a wino?

15:41.500 --> 15:44.840
That's right. I wouldn't coach a sumo club!

15:44.840 --> 15:45.840
Wait a minute!

15:45.840 --> 15:49.510
Don't you underestimate the club because it's an elementary school club!

15:49.510 --> 15:52.680
Don't you get on a high horse because you had one good cross!

15:52.680 --> 15:54.850
Anyone would be able to do that!

15:54.850 --> 15:58.600
Hey, hey, that's not a very nice thing to say!

15:58.600 --> 16:01.350
Stop laughing, you're giving me a bad taste in the mouth!

16:01.350 --> 16:05.190
Besides, nobody would want a drunkard as a coach!

16:06.230 --> 16:07.400
Then,

16:07.400 --> 16:09.030
let me prove you the opposite.

16:14.280 --> 16:16.580
<i>He stole the ball so easily.</i>

16:33.300 --> 16:34.800
What's he up to?

16:41.980 --> 16:42.940
Let's do this!

16:47.520 --> 16:49.610
So bad! He couldn't even scorel!

16:59.580 --> 17:01.080
What the hell?!

17:08.550 --> 17:09.920
That's how it's done!

17:09.920 --> 17:11.300
Awesome!

17:11.300 --> 17:13.420
W-Wow!

17:13.420 --> 17:16.470
So, do you want me as your coach?

17:16.470 --> 17:18.810
Yes! Of course I do!

17:20.600 --> 17:22.930
Of course! We'll leave this in your hat! Right, Tsuba...

17:24.850 --> 17:25.690
Hey?

17:25.690 --> 17:27.190
All right!

17:29.230 --> 17:30.190
Tsubasa!

17:34.450 --> 17:35.570
He wouldn't...

17:45.500 --> 17:46.710
Tsubasa!

17:46.710 --> 17:48.460
Oops!

17:48.460 --> 17:50.500
Hey, you okay?

17:51.460 --> 17:53.260
This is difficult!

17:53.260 --> 17:56.800
Still, you have an incredible jump!

17:56.800 --> 18:00.140
Indeed! I've got a good feeling about you, Tsubasa!

18:00.140 --> 18:01.310
Really?

18:01.310 --> 18:02.310
Yes!

18:05.640 --> 18:07.480
Okay, I'll try again!

18:07.480 --> 18:09.810
You can't do it so quickly!

18:09.810 --> 18:11.690
I bet I can!

18:11.690 --> 18:13.320
What...?

18:15.070 --> 18:19.200
<i>He just saw my move, and is trying to copy it right away.</i>

18:21.200 --> 18:23.240
<i>Now wonder he's progressing rapidly.</i>

18:27.120 --> 18:31.960
<i>He's the kind who's got a thirst for assimilating all techniques he sees.</i>

18:32.840 --> 18:34.010
Eh?

18:36.550 --> 18:37.930
He missed again.

18:39.220 --> 18:40.890
Are you all right?

18:40.890 --> 18:43.930
Father like son,

18:43.930 --> 18:46.270
don't you think, captain Ozora?!

18:52.690 --> 18:58.200
<i>Sign: <i>Natsuko:
Tsubasa's run away!</i></i>

18:54.570 --> 19:02.160
Just like I thought, my little footballer is skipping out.

19:02.160 --> 19:05.040
It's just like him, after all.

19:05.040 --> 19:05.700
Captain!

19:07.210 --> 19:09.040
So this is where you were.

19:09.540 --> 19:11.420
We are approaching Japan.

19:11.420 --> 19:14.840
Yeah, I'll finally be able to go home.

19:14.840 --> 19:18.260
By the way, how old has your son gotten?

19:18.260 --> 19:21.390
He's turned ten years old this year and is in his last year of elementary school.

19:21.390 --> 19:23.300
Ten years already, eh?

19:23.300 --> 19:28.060
Are you going to get him a game as a gift from your trip this time?

19:28.060 --> 19:30.940
No, he's already got his present.

19:33.110 --> 19:36.030
And it's the most beautiful thing imaginable.

19:55.590 --> 19:58.800
Whoa, the sky and the ground's getting mixed together...

19:59.720 --> 20:01.590
I'm a little dizzy...

20:01.590 --> 20:03.430
Tsubasa!

20:03.430 --> 20:07.430
Even you can't learn this technique that fast!

20:07.430 --> 20:08.930
I'm sure I can!

20:13.350 --> 20:15.860
But it'll be dark soon...

20:15.860 --> 20:18.030
It's time to go home!

20:18.030 --> 20:19.860
Besides, I'm starving!

20:20.700 --> 20:21.860
Not yet!

20:28.370 --> 20:30.750
<i>Roberto says he's got a good feeling about me.</i>

20:34.170 --> 20:36.040
<i>We can do this!</i>

20:42.470 --> 20:46.140
<i>He's still not good enough at the overhead kick.</i>

20:46.140 --> 20:50.230
<i>But he's hitting the crossbar at every try now.</i>

20:50.850 --> 20:52.890
<i>He's got amazing control! </i>

20:53.940 --> 20:56.690
<i>Sign: Challenge from Tsubasa Ozora</i>

21:02.400 --> 21:05.030
<i>Observe carefully!</i>

21:06.780 --> 21:09.410
<i>Look at the goal!</i>

21:11.160 --> 21:14.420
<i>That's our target!</i>

21:14.920 --> 21:16.630
<i>Let's score this time!</i>

21:18.090 --> 21:19.590
Let's do this!

21:34.190 --> 21:36.350
Go in!

21:39.610 --> 21:41.440
